<task id="033" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Author NEW infrastructure/bicep/platform-controlplane.bicep — L2 orchestrator infrastructure</title>
    <phase>C Wave C2 — Bicep + UAMI</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Deployment-touching new stack for the L2 control plane; enables Phase D + F. task-create Step 3.5.5 FULL (deploy tag; azure-deployment scope; NEW surface).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Brief rubric: high-blast-radius Bicep authoring for the ORCHESTRATOR's home infra — App Service + Cosmos + platform KV + App Insights + Log Analytics — every provisioning run flows through this stack. Getting the SKU / capacity / monitoring topology right first time is architectural.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>waveC2-parallel</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>azure, bicep, azure-deployment, deploy, l2-controlplane</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
